// R749 coherent memory-analysis epoch.
// Deep reconstruction is performed once for each authority: core, MemorySSA,
// lifetime, points-to, Mod/Ref and forwarding. Forwarding uses the proven path,
// so it consumes already-reconstructed points-to and Mod/Ref facts instead of
// recursively rebuilding them for every load. The published epoch is then a
// cheap structural receipt over one CIR, one Graph v2 and one generation.
